Z||000000||FLASHY||10-16-2001||01:32 AM||||Hi everyone, I have some encouraging news for those who are in favour of Lambo kits. I sent an email earlier to Alan Schrager (owner of EuroWorks Ltd.) and asked him a few questions. The red text is what Alan wrote back to me. Now please keep in mind that this is not official news and I don't wish for Alan to get involved with any trouble (he clearly states that he was <B>told</B> this) but I'm showing you all what he wrote to me.<P>---------------------------<P>To Alan Schrager or whomever can help,<BR> <BR>Hi, ...I'm sure you are constantly swamped with emails and questions but I hope you have the time to answer a few of mine.<BR> <BR>I understand that Lamborghini is attempting to stop the production of Lambo kits and was wondering if this is affecting EuroWorks in any way?<BR> <BR><FONT COLOR="red">I have been told this was a hoax.</FONT><BR> <BR>Second, I've noticed in your Mirage K photo gallery that some of the pictures show kits with pop-up headlights and some without. Also, some have those lines or grooves formed in the lower sides and some without. Which would be the correct kit I'd receive if I purchased one?<P><FONT COLOR="red">Pop up light comes with kit. Strakes in bottom don't.</FONT><BR> <BR>And finally, what is the process for delivering a Stage II Package to Alberta, Canada?<BR>        -How it is delivered.<BR><FONT COLOR="red">By truck freight</FONT><BR>        -Pricing to have it delivered across the border.<BR><FONT COLOR="red">That I would have to check on. And you would have to get a broker to handle it on your side.</FONT><BR>        -Basically the TOTAL cost expected to have it delivered to my door USD or CAD (not including the Package price itself).<BR> <BR><FONT COLOR="red">I would expect appx $1200 plus taxes and duties.</FONT><BR> <BR>If you could answer these questions I would greatly appreciate it. Thank you for your time.<BR> <BR><FONT COLOR="red">Alan</FONT><P><BR>----------------------<P>So there you have it. He's been told it was a hoax.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cool_yahoo.gif">  I hope that's true for my sake. *fingers crossed*<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/spinsig3.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by FLASHY (edited 10-16-2001).]||||reg||4
