Z||000003||Archie||10-16-2001||08:50 PM||||I totally agree with Alan in his belief that this was a hoax.<P>There are a couple of Lambo manufacturers who  like to use that ploy once in a while to boost sales.<P>When you get old like me, everytime someone mentions something it remonds you of a story. I can tell you a dandy store that took place in 1993 when IFG used this hoax to boost sales of the Lambos.<P>In his own words, he told me that he took in over $140,000 in down payments, in 6 months, using that hoax. I don't know how many of those people who bit on it that time actually followed thru and paid the rest of the money to complete the transaction. I just know that $140K in downpayments is good money when you consider that not one product has to be shipped on only a down pmt.<P>I could tell you all the details but it was one of the slickest scams he ever pulled. He never volunteered the info on the hoax but I had figured it out and asked him about it like it was fact when I was out there one time.<P>Anyway I'll tell you all the details about how it worked sometime.<P>Archie ||||reg||1
